			<div class="content" id="post-content-1992318">
									

<p>I like this SCP, but I do have a few problems with it&#8230; well namely two.</p>
<p>The first problem that I find with this SCP is that it's thaumiel. From what I understand thaumiel is meant to be like super-keter. Correct/forgive me if I'm wrong, but if my understanding is correct from what I read, the use of this SCP was discontinued, therefore I don't believe its object class should be thaumiel seeing as it poses no threat unless it is in use. Once again correct/forgive me if I'm wrong.</p>
<p>The second problem I have is that this only has one example of its use explained, which in this case is a popular SCP article of a popular avatar of the site. I feel like more of examples of its use would improve the article because it would help to take away from the whole &quot;oh they only referenced a popular article to get up-votes&quot; and because I feel like it tell more of a story about itself. (especially to those who are new to the site and would not get the reference to Dr. Bright's &quot;family&quot; which I will admit I didn't get right away either)</p>
<p>Now don't get me wrong I like this SCP as is, but I can't see myself up-voting it until it has more content about the SCP itself. So far it's a no vote from me.</p>

